@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title MIXED CORE / FUTURE — Proposed — One authoritative work model, multiple permitted projections
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

database "Owned canonical work model\nitems / tasks / state / assignment / ordering\nSprint goal + selected scope + delivery plan" as D
rectangle "Current authorized query / mutation contract" as Q
rectangle "Kanban board\ncolumn mapping / card placement" as K
rectangle "Permitted list / summary projection" as L
rectangle "Optional timeline / calendar view\nonly if actual source choice adopted" as T
rectangle "Protected mutation\nexpected versions + policy / criteria guards" as M
D --> Q : same authoritative state
Q --> K
Q --> L
Q ..> T : not newly selected feature
K --> M : drag is a command, not local truth
L --> M : explicit edits
M --> D : coherent guarded update
note bottom of D
 A board is not a second Sprint Backlog.
 Views do not store contradictory acceptance/status copies.
 Partial queries are not complete report totals.
end note

@enduml
